## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

### **Foundation Rules**
All generated code must follow:
- Code generation standards: TypeScript format, absolute imports, naming conventions, code quality
- Project structure: File placement rules, access control, folder organization

### **Architecture Patterns**
All test automation code must follow:
- **[Layered Architecture](mdc:ArchitectureLayeredDesign.mdc)** - Test → Business → Page Objects → AIElement → Cache
- **[Locator Management](mdc:LocatorManagementSystem.mdc)** - Cache-first approach, AIElement-only access
- Hierarchical logging: TestLogger at all layers (testStep, businessStep, pageStep)

### **Application-Specific**
When applicable:
- Table view detection and AITomsPage usage (see **[Phase3_ImplementationStandards](mdc:Phase3_ImplementationStandards.mdc)**)

